  "details": "I have an attention disorder and anxiety to throw at it. I am not good on big changes when it effects my playstyle. I am not saying it's a bad thing to change things. and upgrade the game. but I am hoping to ask for a possible opt out option from the current menu so that people like me can adjust to the changes? I find the new menu very difficult to navigate and it's very confusing to me. it will take me a while to figure out. and I would feel better if there was an opt out option so that I can take some time to adjust to the changes. thank you for taking your time to read this.",
